  {
   "id": "eldrador-creatures-shadowfall-324762@1.1",
   "gameId": "eldrador-creatures-shadowfall-324762",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-04-16T07:21:40.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "-Over the last couple of weeks, we’ve watched dozens of hours of playthroughs and gathered valuable player feedback. Our first update introduces quality-of-life improvements and aims to clarify battle mechanics by enhancing the user interface.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "What´s new",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "-Creatures that will take collision damage when pushed against objects or other creatures now have a new preview icon above them. The collision damage is also displayed as a separate number.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Added new icons for collecting mana and healing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Attack preview: A new white creature outline now indicates which tile the creature will move to.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Added new tooltip for tiles that will spawn mana.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Mini Creatures now have segmented health bars to visualize how many Mini Creatures remain.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Improved the tutorial.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Creature info now also shows the crit chance (which is usually 15%).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Minor bug fixes and SFX improvements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "And our game DEMO is live now!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for playing. We hope you enjoy these changes. :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
